title: What's in the punch?
from: Pell Okafor
gist: At the Line supper, Pell tried to guess what's in Brennan's punch.
== lines
pell > you: You carried it up. You know. What's in the punch? It's ginger. It's definitely ginger.   [listen]
? choice
* No idea. Ask Brennan.   rel:brennan+1 flavour:practical mem:line.secret.kept
  pell: She'd tell me. She wouldn't. You're both the same. Unbearable.   [laugh]
* It's pickle brine.   rel:pell+1 flavour:share mem:line.secret.told
